			"Message": "style(Common): Normalize tables, comments, and list indent\n\nConsistent formatting across Architecture.md, README.md, and Source/IPC/Channel.rs: align table pipes, soft-wrap long blockquote lines, convert em dashes to hyphens in non-prose contexts, fix list-item indentation, and normalize comment whitespace in the legacy channels block.\n\nThe README CHANGELOG bullet now uses the same indent depth as every other sub-item, the Shim Compatibility table renders uniformly in markdown renderers, and the legacy wire-shape doc block in Channel.rs follows the same paragraph style as the rest of the file.",
